    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": ", , ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Yeah, I pulled up in that eighteenth letter repeat buggy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Had to switch the hue 'cause them LA boys smuggy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But more likely to get hurt by somebody who love me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "My lady, she don't trust me, know I'm a sick puppy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Know that women throw themselves at me and men want me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Anything could happen for attention and rent money",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I got so much on my plate, that's why I sit funny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "So many hand-outs, so much back bending",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "So much entitlement my family be actin' in",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "So many white diamonds, yеah, I got jungle fever",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "But thеy didn't raise me, so shout out black women",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "So much commentin', show me what you good at",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Tell me the highs of the valley that your boots stood at",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "You couldn't fit in my loafers if you took a steroid",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "And I wouldn't handle your baggage if I had a bellboy",
          "rhyme": "Oj",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I'm rarely replying to texts, barely enjoying the sex",
          "rhyme": "Eks",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "I got a pain in my chest, that's from suppressin' the stress",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Lionel, he know me the best",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Told me I know the answer, but Clancy, he gave me the best advice that I heard in a sec'",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "I need to call me a jet, I need to pack me a bag",
          "rhyme": "ag",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "I need to get me a cabin, need some scrimmage in chess",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "I could've bought me some land, I went and flooded my neck",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "I say this shit with my chest, I am like one of the best (Greatest)",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "I am a workaholic and I need to get me some rest",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "I'd rather get these ideas off, I'd rather not steer off my path",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "I'm so scared of going back to my past",
          "rhyme": "ast",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "I work, I swear it's hard not shaking that fear off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "White boy said I brag too much, the black kid said it's inspiring",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Duality is tiring, my girl would kill me if she knew the things I was desiring",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Suppressing it, get it out the way, I put the sirens in, yeah",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABABCADEFGHHHIJKLMNKMLLOPQDDC",
