    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": ", ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Look, I don't fuck with parties, I don't fuck with the paparazzi",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Never have I drove a Hellcat or a Maserati",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Never needed others for my personal validation",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "She ain't gettin' touched if she cannot hold a conversation",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Never had a bulky Richard Mille as a wristwatch",
          "rhyme": "atS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I never seen Amiri, never posted on TikTok",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I never had desire for promethazine in a soda",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Never made eye contact with a woman in Fashion Nova",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Never had to fit in no lane",
          "rhyme": "an",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Never wore Beats By Dre headphones to get a video made, uh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Bunnyhop validated, pedaling",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Hittin' wheelies like Chris retaliated, just look around",
          "rhyme": "awnd",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Every opportunity allocated",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I put so many niggas on, you thought DJ Khaled made it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "From cold showers, I used to hate it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Now I'm spendin' fifteen for the new roof, it ain't renovated",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "I could see the ocean where I sleep and the house is gated",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "No Calabasas, I Brentwood it or Palisade it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "The freckled girls articulating art got me salivating (I love it)",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Wall is Henry Taylor with the trunks, I be playing Jenga",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "The last tour, dog, I cleaned house",
          "rhyme": "awz",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "They mad I made it, I'm so conceited",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Feeling myself, ego masturbating, I graduated",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "After album five, I got syndicated, you want the old T?",
          "rhyme": "t",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Sorry G, that picture faded",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Come get wit' me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
