      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Yeah, I'm a dead poet (Poet), tabletop stumpin' (Stumpin')",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm a free spirit, have the whole jail jumpin' (Jumpin')",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Ever since a youngin', moved at my pace (At my own)",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Scared of having youngins 'cause I like my space (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Selfish ain't the word (Nope), regret ain't either (Nuh-uh)",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Before you get the huffin' and the puffin', take a breather (Hah-hah-hah)",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Put yourself first if you're livin' with a dream (Put yourself first)",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Be your biggest cheerleader, motherfuck the team",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "One",
          "rhyme": "On",
